• Work within an agile team to ensure the quality of complex MEAN applications;

• Develop, modify, and execute functional test scripts and analyze bugs for systems in development;

• Work closely with developers to recognize the potential for any operational issues, assess risks, and resolve issues proactively;

• Create test automation frameworks from the ground up using Selenium WebDriver;

• Automate API testing using Postman and similar tools;

• Perform load testing using a variety of tools as per industry standards and suggest solutions for performance issues;

• Perform penetration testing and another security-related testing as needed;

• Record defect details and create reports outlining the types of defects found and the steps taken to resolve them and update the regression test framework;

